                        (McCone) Files: Job 80-B01285A, Box
                        2,DCI (McCone) Memo for the Record, 7 April-21 August 1962. Secret;
                    Eyes Only. Prepared by McCone.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d350-f2" n="1" xml:id="d350-f2-content">
                <p>Reference is to James Donovan, an attorney
                    who became involved in renewed negotiations with the Cuban Government concerning
                    the possible release of the prisoners held in Cuba who were captured during the
                    Bay of Pigs invasion.</p>
            </note>
